<p style="margin:0 0 8px;">Hi Support,</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 20px;">Salesforce refused to refresh the connection for a customer org. This is not something a reconnect alone fixes, so the customer has been told to contact you.</p>

<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:10px;">
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:13px 18px;font-size:13px;color:#64748b;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;">Problem</td>
    <td style="padding:13px 18px;font-size:13px;color:#0f172a;font-weight:600;text-align:right;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;"><%= problemLabel %></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:13px 18px;font-size:13px;color:#64748b;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;">Org</td>
    <td style="padding:13px 18px;font-size:13px;color:#0f172a;font-weight:600;text-align:right;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;"><%= crmName %> (<%= organizationId %>)</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:13px 18px;font-size:13px;color:#64748b;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;">DataCraft user</td>
    <td style="padding:13px 18px;font-size:13px;color:#0f172a;font-weight:600;text-align:right;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;"><%= userId %></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:13px 18px;font-size:13px;color:#64748b;">Detected</td>
    <td style="padding:13px 18px;font-size:13px;color:#0f172a;font-weight:600;text-align:right;"><%= detectedAt %></td>
  </tr>
</table>

<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin-top:14px;">
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:13px 16px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#b91c1c;background-color:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fecaca;border-radius:8px;"><%= salesforceError %></td>
  </tr>
</table>

<p style="margin:20px 0 0;">Full history is in the token event log (data-vault-token-events) for this user.</p>
